Stock-Sniper bug fix, separate from the CXRay integration (not counted in Table VII's line count).
Sniper main (8.1 + MimicOS merge, commit eb4d16c) dropped m_tag_directory_present(false) from the
MemoryManager initializer list; with any shared last-level cache (shared_cores > 1) the
'Tag directories may only be at master node' check then reads an uninitialised bool and aborts.

